{title: Maula Mere Maula}
{artist: Roop Kumar Rathore Anwar}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Maula mere maula mere,        [Am]Maula mere maula mere
[Dm]Maula mere maula mere,        [Dm]Maula mere maula mere...x2
Aankhein [C]teri..... [Dm] ... [G],        [C]Aaa.... [Dm]aaa... [G]
Aankhein [C]teri kitni [Am]haseen,        [Dm]Ki inka [G]aashiq [Dm]mai ban [G]gaya hun
[Dm]Mujhako [G]basaale iname [C]tu,        [Am]Maula mere maula mere
[Am]Maula mere maula mere,        [Dm]Maula mere maula mere
[Dm]Maula mere maula mere...x2,        [Dm]Ki inka [G]aashiq [Dm]mai ban [G]gaya hun
[Dm]Mujhako [G]basaale iname [C]tu,        [Am]Mujhase yeh har ghadi [G]mera dil kahe
[F]Tum hi ho usaki [G]aarzoo,        [Am]Mujhse ye har ghadi [G]mere lab kahe
[F]Teri hi ho sab [G]guftagoo,        Baatein [C]teri itni [Am]haseen
[Dm]Mai yaad [G]inko [Dm]jab kar [G]taa hun,        [Dm]Phoolon si [G]aaye khusha [C]boo
[Am]Rakh loon chhupaake mai [G]kahi tuzko,        [F]Saayaa bhi teraa naa main [G]doon
[Am]Rakh loon bana ke kahi [G]ghar mai tuze,        [F]Saath tere main hi [G]rahoon
Julfen [C]teri itni [Am]ghani,        [Dm]Dekh ke [G]inko [Dm]ye soch [G]taa hoon
[Dm]Saaye me [G]inke mai [C]jiyu,        [Am]Maula mere maula mere
[Am]Maula mere maula mere,        [Dm]Maula mere maula mere
[Dm]Maula mere maula mere...x2,        [Am]Dil yahi bola mera dil yahi bola yara
[Dm]Raaz yeh usne hai mujh par khola ki hai,        [Am]Ishq mohabbat jiske dil mein
[Dm]Usko pasand karta hai maulaa mera
